        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "8c340c5a-3ede-58d5-b479-7a897d6c166e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roger Taylor, Elizabeth Fraser, Robin Guthrie\n- Bands: Queen, Cocteau Twins\n- Albums: Head over Heels\n- Companies: 4AD\n- Places: Grangemouth, Scotland\n- Topics: musician biographies, album release\n\nFacts:\n- Roger Taylor was born on 26 July 1949 and is an English musician, singer, and songwriter.\n- Elizabeth Fraser was born on 29 August 1963, is also known as Liz Fraser, and is a British singer, songwriter, and musician from Grangemouth, Scotland.\n- Elizabeth Fraser is best known as the vocalist for the band Cocteau Twins.\n- Head over Heels was released in October 1983 by 4AD.\n- Head over Heels was the first Cocteau Twins album made as a duo of Elizabeth Fraser and Robin Guthrie.",
